{"message": "Fixed the defects causing the `tests/drivers/i2c/i2c_emul` build and test failure on `native_sim`:

1. **`tests/drivers/i2c/i2c_emul/boards/native_sim.overlay`**: Added the missing size cell (`4`) to the `reg` property of `i2c1: i2c@400` (`reg = <0x400 4>;`) to match the root node's `#address-cells = <1>` and `#size-cells = <1>`.
2. **`drivers/i2c/Kconfig.i2c_emul`**: Fixed the inverted dependency on `DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_I2C_EMUL_CONTROLLER_ENABLED` (removed the `!` negation) so `CONFIG_I2C_EMUL` is enabled when `zephyr,i2c-emul-controller` devicetree nodes are present.", "kind": "FinishAction"}

